Regulatory reference content

The regulatory tracker (supabase/migrations/024_regulatory_tracker.sql and
related) summarises public law and official guidance and cites primary sources
for each entry. Those summaries are BROC's own text and carry the licence
above. They are not legal advice and are not a substitute for reading the
instrument itself or taking advice on it. Confidence ratings and verification
dates are recorded per entry; treat anything unverified as unverified.

Emission factors

BROC ships no proprietary emission factor sets. Factors are loaded by the
deploying organization from sources it is licensed to use. Some public factor
sets (DEFRA, EPA, IEA and others) carry their own terms, and those terms travel
with the data, not with this software.

